> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF, VERBOSE)
> SELECT variance(unique1::int4), sum(unique1::int8)
> FROM (SELECT * FROM a7_pa UNION ALL SELECT * FROM a7_pa) u
QUERY PLAN:text
Finalize Aggregate
  Output: variance(a7_pa.unique1), sum((a7_pa.unique1)::bigint)
  ->  Gather
        Output: (PARTIAL variance(a7_pa.unique1)), (PARTIAL sum((a7_pa.unique1)::bigint))
        Workers Planned: 4
        ->  Partial Aggregate
              Output: PARTIAL variance(a7_pa.unique1), PARTIAL sum((a7_pa.unique1)::bigint)
              ->  Parallel Append
                    ->  Parallel Seq Scan on public.a7_pa
                          Output: a7_pa.unique1
                    ->  Parallel Seq Scan on public.a7_pa a7_pa_1
                          Output: a7_pa_1.unique1
-- EXPLAIN

